    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "A {@link NullReader} subclass that fills in real character values so the tests can assert on the exact bytes produced. <p> Both overrides derive each character from the reader's current position: the character at position {@code p} is the value {@code p} itself. This makes the expected values trivially predictable in the assertions below (position 0 yields 0, position 1 yields 1, and so on). </p>"
   },
